OL,3,GNEWSADUP leader 'hopes' Carla Lockhart
OL,4,Awill not leave the party
OL,5,
OL,6,FDemocratic Unionist Party (DUP) leader
OL,7,FGavin Robinson has said he does not
OL,8,Fwant to see Upper Bann MP Carla
OL,9,FLockhart leave the party.
OL,11,FLockhart has called for the DUP to
OL,12,Fremove First Minister Michelle O'Neill
OL,13,Ffrom office by having Emma
OL,14,FLittle-Pengelly resign from her role as
OL,15,Fdeputy first minister.
OL,17,FHowever, on Thursday the DUP confirmed
OL,18,Fthat Little-Pengelly would not
OL,19,Fparticipate in joint engagements with
OL,20,FO'Neill and permission would not be
OL,21,Fgranted for the first minister to
OL,22,Foperate on a solo basis.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
