OL,3,GNEWSADUP leader 'hopes' Carla Lockhart
OL,4,Awill not leave the party
OL,5,
OL,6,FSinn Fein MP John Finucane called the
OL,7,Fmove "an example of economic sabotage,
OL,8,Fof self-harm, by the DUP, all because
OL,9,Fthey struggle with internal party
OL,10,Fcohesion".
